## 5. Quick Verification

To verify that your project compiles and functions correctly with `@codernic/ui-components`:

```bash
# 1. Typecheck the consumer codebase
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit

# 2. Run unit & integration tests
pnpm test

# 3. Validate dual-stack CompileGate
coc-pm build
```
